  "description": "Unpackerr queue states, Starr queue polling and extraction throughput. Metrics verified against Unpackerr v1.0.0 pkg/unpackerr/metrics.go (unpackerr_gauges{name}, unpackerr_counters{name}, unpackerr_app_queue_size, unpackerr_app_queue_fetch_total, unpackerr_app_queue_fetch_errors_total, unpackerr_app_queue_fetch_time_seconds, unpackerr_archives_read_total, unpackerr_bytes_written_total, unpackerr_files_extracted_total, the unpackerr_extract_time_seconds histogram) plus the client_golang go_/process_ collectors, all checked on a running instance; the project publishes no dashboard.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
